      "message": "Pre-existing, so not for this CL, but - while currently in ConnectivityService a network can only have one LinkProperties and a LinkProperties can have only one interface (well, except for stacked interfaces), it\u0027s possible for the network to change interfaces. So for example, a VPN could go from ipsec37 to ipsec42. Similarly I think cellular can go from a true cellular interface (e.g., rmnet_data0) to an IWLAN interface (e.g., ipsec42).\n\nCan you file a bug to make the idletimers correct when that happens?",
